<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux trade surplus grows in January.</title>
<headline>Belgolux trade surplus grows in January.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Office released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs) -</p>
<p>    BELGOLUX TRADE		   Jan 97    Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
<p>    Exports			    448.1     412.2     429.6</p>
<p>    Imports			    409.5     401.0     400.0</p>
<p>    Balance			     38.6	11.2	20.5</p>
<p>					Jan-Dec 96*	    Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p>    Exports (cumulative)	 5,247.1		 5,016.4</p>
<p>    Imports (cumulative)	 4,867.1		 4,580.8</p>
<p>    Balance			    380.0		   435.5</p>
<p>* revised</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
